window.products.push({"id":514005,"name":"Ultrasonic Humidifiers - 3.5L (1 Gallon) Cool Mist Humidifier with Low/High Mist Levels, Waterless Auto Shut-Off and Night Light Mode, Ultra Quiet Hum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PjKQ7fi1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bpa-free Plastic 【QUIET COOL MIST HUMIDIFIER KEEPS YOU HYDRATED】With autumn and winter come dry air, leaving us with dry sinuses, dry skin, nosebleeds, and especially in a room with the heater running, a humidifier is a must to rinse the dry air. Also, it is efficient to alleviate the torture and pain when the unbearable season comes with hay fever, nasal stuffiness, and allergies. This cool humidifier is a satisfying choice for anyone who is expecting better indoor air quality. 【 HIGH-CAPACITY & EXTRA LONG WORKING HOURS】3.5 Liter water tank capacity safely humidifies the air from 10 and up to 16 hours with continuous operating before the water runs out. It provides you with long lasting moist air. Furthermore, this air humidifier has a 360° nozzle, therefore it provides ideal coverage for various places, such as bedrooms, nursery rooms, and offices, or any other medium-sized rooms. 【NOISELESS OPERATING AND SWITCHABLE DIM NIGHT LIGHT MODE】The optional relaxing blue night light makes it suitable as a nursery humidifier for babies and kids. Ultrasonic air diffusion produces less than 36 dB for quiet humidification that even babies cannot hear it is operating. This humidifier won’t interrupt your sweet dream, you can sleep comfortably while clean and moist air is around you. 【ADJUSTABLE MIST LEVEL & 3-TIMING CONTROLLING OPTION】Knob adjustment provide the mist output of High / Low Mist levels to fit the room humidity and your comfort level. The timer setting allows the cool humidifier works for 1/3/6 hours per your demand before the humidifier turning off automatically, which is perfectly flexible for use and suitable for baby and families. The detachable power adapter makes it easier to pour water out and cleaning instead of carrying the cord around. 【REST ASSURED TO PURCHASE THIS HUMIDIFIER】We are confident that our products are manufactured under strict quality standards to give our customers the best experience. Sparoma is a convincing brand and we provide intimate after-sales service. Once purchased this humidifier, you are guaranteed to get a FREE REPLACEMENT POLICY without any cost from your side and 1-YEAR WARRANTY, totally no risk for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PjKQ7fi1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sparoma","source_asin":"B07PJZGGPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PJZGGPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PJZGGPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
