window.products.push({"id":514358,"name":"CHEFS Measuring Spoons, Set of 9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lj2pIhgpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CHEFS measuring spoons feature long easy-grip handles to reach into tall jars and canisters, allowing easy balance for precise measure. Extended sizes to easily halve, double or triple recipes, without calculating fractions. This durable stainless-steel spoon set includes standard sizes: 1/4-, 1/2-teaspoon, 1-teaspoon and 1-tablespoon, plus 1/16-, 1/8-, 2/3-, 1 1/2-teaspoon and 2-teaspoon. Heavy-gauge 18/8 measuring spoons with solid round-shape bowl and substantial rim to easily level ingredients. Polished stainless-steel for smooth release. Durable to withstand the daily use in restaurant kitchens, CHEFS measuring spoons are rustproof, stainproof and nonreactive to acidic or dairy ingredients. Quick to identify with measurements permanently engraved in US and metric units on handles. Will not bend or warp for a lifetime of use. End hanging loop and storage ring. Nest to store. Dishwasher-safe. CHEFS signature collection of professional-quality cookware, kitchen tools, bakeware, dinnerware and more is meticulously crafted and tested to delight the most discerning cook. CHEFS commitment to innovative, functional design is the key to delivering products of exceptional quality, performance and durability for home and professional kitchens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lj2pIhgpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MiToo","source_asin":"B00EHNO8OA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EHNO8OA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EHNO8OA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":514359,"name":"[2022 New] 2 in 1 Instant Read Meat Thermometer for Cooking, Fast & Precise Digital Food Thermometer with Backlight, Magnet, and Dual Foldable Probe f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819pgmjReSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Accuracy & Instant Read: Meat thermometer takes only 2-3 seconds read the temperature in a wide range of -58℉-572℉ (-50°C~300°C), and the accuracy is up to +/- 1 degree. Take out the guesswork, and avoid undercooking or overcooking leading to ruining the good ingredients. Perfectly cooked beef, chicken, fish, pork, lamb or turkey every time. It is also very suitable for beverages, baking and candy. Food Grade Dual Probe: Safe stainless steel probes with a diameter of 1.7mm is very easy to insert into the meat and meet all your requirements for temp measurement in the kitchen. The 4.6-inch built-in probe is suitable for holding the host to immediately read the current temp. The external probe with 42 inch cable (Heat-resistant up to 380°C) can be used for ovenl/gril/smoker to understand the real-time temp of meat/bread. (Note: Thermometer host do not put it in a pot or oven.) Perfect Indoor or Outdoor: Whether you’re cooking in the kitchen, grilling on your weber or char-broil, or sitting around the campfire, digital food thermometers will take your culinary skills to the next level! Press \"HOLD\" to lock the temperature, the LCD screen with blue backlight allows you to read clearly in bright or dark environments. Become a more confident and professional chef! Temp Alarm & IP67 Waterproof: The temperature setting can refer to the meat temperature chart. Pre-set the temperature, the smart thermometer will remind you by flashing the big screen when is reached. With IP67 waterproof, the grill thermometer is super easy to clean. (NOTE: Please wipe it with a soapy cloth or rinse it to clean, and DO NOT soak it or put in a dishwasher.) Easy to Use & Convenient Storage: Rotate the built-in probe or insert the wired probe into the pinhole to turn it on, fold or unplug the probe to turn it off. The automatic shutdown function after 10 minutes of inactivity helps to save power and extend the use time. The ergonomic handle makes cooking a enjoyment! Built-in magnets and hanging holes make it easy to stick on the refrigerator or hang it anywhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819pgmjReSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BREEKET","source_asin":"B099Z2F4JZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099Z2F4JZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099Z2F4JZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
