window.products.push({"id":514428,"name":"LakeMono 100% Cotton Knitted Throw Blanket Super Soft Fish Bone Pattern Bedroom Couch/Sofa Cover Quilt(White and Black,47’’ x 71’’)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IrnoA8WlL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material: 100% Cotton  Size: 47\" × 71\" /71” × 79” Available Color: White/Beige/Coffee/Light Grey/ Deep Grey/Red/Deep Green/Light Green/Pink/Azure/Navy/Dark Green Craft: Twist Usage of Blanket: Shawl of the office Sweet couples blanket Prepared for boarding Family use blanket, sofa blanket, decoration blanket Outside: Long-distance in car necessary blanket, close-fitting throw blanket Care and Cleaning: It is normal for cotton products to have slight discoloration and shrinkage during initial washing. After second washing, the situation will disappear completely. 1. For the first time washing, please soak in salt water for 20 minutes so as to ensure that the blanket is bright 2. please use neutral detergent, water temperature 104℉or below 104℉medium temperature washing, dark and green please wash separately, do not bleach and dry cleaning.  3.Due to the large elasticity of knitwear, please wash it separately and do not mix it with other clothes. In addition, please dehydrate and dry after machine washing. 4. if conditions allow, you can use steam ironing, knitted blankets so flat! Cleaning Method: 1. Machine wash: Use the laundry bag with not too close mesh, wash separately according to color system, and use special detergent for wool and silk. 2. Hand washing: soak softener for 3 minutes, then wash it with wool detergent, usually without deformation, and eventually spread it flat to dry. Tips: 1. Please kindly check the size before you buy it. 2. Due to light and computer monitors, the color may vary slightly.  3. Please allow 1-2cm measurement difference due to manual measurement. 4. Any questions about our items or service, please feel free to contact us; we will try our best to solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IrnoA8WlL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LakeMono","source_asin":"B07CWT6C5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CWT6C5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CWT6C5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
