window.products.push({"id":514468,"name":"Personalized Penguin Ornaments for Christmas Tree – Polyresin North Pole Penguin Ornament – Christmas Penguin Decorations – Winter Penguin Christmas O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HfwT1jO4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Winter Tree Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our penguin Christmas decor is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a cute little penguin wrapped in a shiny green scarf with red heart! This Holiday season, make your home extra merry and bright with this charming little penguin ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized penguin Christmas ornaments often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Our penguin Christmas decorations are delicately hand painted to ensure a unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND penguin Holiday ornament you'll always cherish! Add it to your white Christmas ornaments set. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – and the activities that bring you joy and fulfillment. Every year, you decorate your tree with personalized nature ornaments that represent special moments in your life. With our Christmas winter wonderland decorations 2022, expand your collection with the fun ornaments that represent your family’s greatest pleasures. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors, this adorable resin penguin ornaments will make your tree feel truly special and unique! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our penguin ornaments make beautiful addition to your winter wonderland party decorations, winter tree decorations and white Christmas tree ornaments set to cherish every season. Your penguin decor will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! This whimsical ornament will bring some Holiday cheer to your home! The perfect penguin gifts for kids and families that will surely be cherish forever! Happy Families – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful penguin and polar bear ornaments for winter Christmas decorations for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your north pole ornaments, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HfwT1jO4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07GC8VXFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GC8VXFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GC8VXFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":514469,"name":"Classical Creations Gray Wolf Howling at The Moon in a Nighttime Forest 12\" Silent Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iEyLf3d0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a beautiful wall clock featuring an image of a gray wolf standing in a dark forest, howling at the moon. It is approximately 12\" in diameter. This would make a great gift or personal item for anyone who enjoys images of nature. About Our 12\" Wall Clocks Attractive and functional, our 12\" wall clocks feature beautiful photo-quality artwork and reliable USA-made clock motors. The 1/4\" thick wood base is a premium Certified Green Product that is durable and environmentally friendly. The classic look and quiet operation of our clocks make them perfect for just about any room in your home or office. We are sure you will be proud to give them as gifts or treasure them yourself for years to come. Our Classic Artwork Most traditional artwork is rectangular, which leads to the question: \"How do you fit a square piece of artwork on a round clock?\" Most \"fine art\" clocks are made by either cropping a circle in the center of the artwork discarding much of the original image, or shrinking the image down and adding plain borders to fill the extra space. We chose to do something different. Our graphic artists start with a high-resolution copy of the original image, and use state-of-the-art software to digitally \"mold\" the rectangular artwork on the face of a circular clock. Each image is meticulously edited, and care is taken to preserve the integrity of the original artwork while minimizing the distortion inherent in this type of image manipulation. We think you will agree that our clocks are more attractive and capture the look of the original artwork better than other similar offerings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iEyLf3d0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classical Creations","source_asin":"B00BGXCTO0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BGXCTO0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BGXCTO0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
