window.products.push({"id":514504,"name":"Cutting Boards，Durable flexible plastic cutting board mat with food icons 6 colored pad sets with easy grips","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hab9G3wmL._AC_SL1476_.jpg","description":"Still using your old & worn, Cutting Boards?  Most experts recommend replacing plastic mats every two years. When a sponge or dishcloth snags on the board, or your knife skips over deep cuts, it's time for a new one. Your family's health is too important!  - Our sturdy thick and flexible design makes sure that you won't cut through our mats and that they will not wear out as quickly or easily as the other brands  Easy to Clean Non slip cutting board set has a matte finish. No corners and gaps where bacteria can freely propagate, safe and hygienic. Dishwasher safe material allows you to put it in the dishwasher directly. If there are knife marks or scratches caused by scrubber, we recommend replacing them with new ones. Package Including Flexible cutting board X6, 12 x 15 inches. Tired of moldy wooden cutting boards and cheap brittle plastic? Worry about mixing up the cutting board for raw meat and vegetables? Designed for your family's safety and simpler cooking, our veg cutting board helps you avoid cross-contamination between meat and vegetables. Plastic Cutting Board BPA Free Our cutting board sheets are made of durable and flexible PP material, BPA free, color coded for a particular food group. They are suitable for chopping vegetables, fruits, beef, fish, which makes things both hygienic and organized when cooking. Densely Distributed Slip-Resistant Points  The Chop board offers more friction and slip resistance than the crosshatched bottom, which allows it to grip tight to counter surfaces and won't moving around on the counter easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hab9G3wmL._AC_SL1476_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"An innovation","source_asin":"B088TXBT5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088TXBT5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088TXBT5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
