window.products.push({"id":514506,"name":"Ucutely Red White and Blue Star Lights,100LED 8 Modes Plug in Connectable Patriotic String Light Waterproof,Star String Lights for 4th of July,Indepen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+BBoKW01L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🇺🇸【Red White Blue Star String Lights】A string of patriotic star lights consisting of 100, Length between lights : 3.9 Inches/ 10cm, power line: 5m/16.5ft. light string: 10m/33ft, length totally: 15m/49ft approx. The bulbs of our upgraded Memorial Day decoarations light string are bigger and brighter than other mini bulbs.It is the best indoor and outdoor decoration for parties on July 4th, Independence Day, Labor Day, Presidents Day, Memorial Day. 🇺🇸【8 Lighting Modes With Memory Function】 These Independence Day Decoration red white and blue star string lights with 8 Lighting Modes, different lighting effects are controlled by the button on the plug, intelligent memory function design make the string lights will recover from the previous setting mode when you restart the string lights next time. 🇺🇸【End To End Extendable】These 4th of July Decorations String Lights with Male and Female Safe Plug, could be extended to a maximum of 10 light chains, from 49.2 ft to 344.5 ft (maximum 1000 LED),freely conntected according to your demand. Enough To Cover Larger Area. 🇺🇸【100% ETL Certification& Low Voltage】After rigorous testing, not only the red white blue patriotic string light string has passed the ETL certification as a whole, but its raw materials and accessories (such as wires and plugs) are all ETL-certified products. 29V low output voltage make it safe enough for use. High quality certified products ensure the safety of you and your family. 🇺🇸【 IP67 waterproof & Widely Use】The unique Independence Day Decoration satr string lights are suitable for 4th of July, Memorial Day, Independence Day, Labor Day, patriotic-themed party, holiday, home, gazebo, bedroom, and so on.Please note that the transformer is IP67 waterproof, so it can meet normal use outside but not enough to put under water directly, but the mode controller is NOT waterproof so that please keep it away from water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+BBoKW01L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ucutely","source_asin":"B09TSNKLBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSNKLBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSNKLBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
