window.products.push({"id":514514,"name":"Tramontina Select 18/10 Stainless Steel Tri-Ply Base Pressure Cooker, 6.3-Quart, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CavpMQ2bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Tramontina 18/10 stainless steel tri-ply base 6.3 Qtr. Pressure cooker is part of the company's select collection, a series of quality kitchenware items providing excellent functionality, great performance and long-lasting durability. Providing quick heat distribution evenly, without hotspots, this tri-ply base pressure cooker combines impeccable beauty with the quality of 18/10 stainless steel. Its special construction features an impact-bonded base with three layers, consisting of 18/10 stainless steel, an aluminum core for conductivity and magnetic stainless steel exterior, a process which makes this pot perfect for all cooktops, including induction. Due to its unique construction, the Tramontina pressure cooker locks-in essential nutrients, making your meals not only healthier but also improving flavor, all in an energy-saving design that cooks meals in 1/3 the time of conventional cooking methods! the comfortable, cool-touch Bakelite handle features dual pressure settings, low level (1) for fairly tender foods and high (2) for tougher foods, while the helper handle offers safe and secure handling. The special indicators incorporated on the stainless steel lid make pressure cooking both safe and easy, due to the unique pressure safety lock mechanism. Included you will find a handy bilingual (English and Spanish) manual with 28-pages listing complete use & care instructions as well as recommended cooking times for a variety of grains, meat, seafood & fish. Tramontina select 18/10 stainless steel tri-ply base 6.3 Qtr. Pressure cooker is UL-approved, dishwasher and oven-safe (up to 350f / 176c) and compatible with all cooktops. Lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CavpMQ2bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tramontina","source_asin":"B000ZMHDOE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ZMHDOE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ZMHDOE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
