window.products.push({"id":514586,"name":"Admired By Nature Artificial Full Blooming Delphinium Flowers, Flower Buds & Greenery for Home, Wedding, Restaurant & Office Decoration Arrangement, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613X9yUghGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The artificial full blooming delphinium flowers with backdrop of greenery are pretty and easy to blend any type of decoration style. It looks great as it is or mixed well with other floral arrangement. Neat, hassle free and look fresh all the time. Stem is easy to adjust as you required. Suitable for home office decoration, wedding decoration, Spring Summer theme party, floral arrangements, table centerpiece arrangement with your favor vase, or any special events. Overall size: 24H x 15W x 6D Inches per bush. Product may ship compressed. Dimensions based on image shown. Primping required to match the image shown.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613X9yUghGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Admired By Nature","source_asin":"B07662F17H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07662F17H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07662F17H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":514587,"name":"GMOEGEFT Christmas Gnome Singing Christmas Gnome Plush, Christmas Santa Claus with Shaking Hat, Christmas Gnomes Decorations Home Decor Birthday Gift,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q8ZaeZbXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHRISTMAS GNOME - According to Scandinavian folklore, gnomes usually hide from humans and use magic. They are reputed to safeguard the farmer and his family against any misfortune. It will be the perfect decorations in your home. Great for your Christmas Party. SINGING & SHAKING HAT GNOME - Turn on the button and the Christmas gnome can sing and shake his hat until the classic Christmas song ends. Adorably and absolutely delightful, this plush gnome provides easy holiday cheer. Three 1.5V“AA” batteries are required (Not Included), one battery is installed below, and the other two are parallel above (as the picture shows). TIMER FUNCTION - There are 2 modes of this Christmas gnome light. The switch has a “Timer” function, turn it “ON” to keep it light up for 6 hours then it will light off automatically, and 18 hours later, it will light up automatically again. Or choose “OFF” to light off the gnome. (NOTE: The gnome will stop shaking when the song ends. You can control him to start or pause shaking by the button on the back of the hat.) MATERIAL & SIZE - The Christmas gnome is made of premium polyester and plastic, dressed in a classic knit coat, and wore a hat with a cute pompom. The beards are long and they are made of gray faux fur. This gnome measures approximately 17.3 inches in height, and 7 inches in width. (Package includes 1 gnome.) PERFECT CHRISTMAS GIFT - This Holiday Christmas Gnome generally serves as a good gift, as it is not only a doll but also a talisman for the house. Giving this entertaining Christmas gnome to your family or friends and get a smile and laugh out of everybody.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q8ZaeZbXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GMOEGEFT","source_asin":"B0B49TY1MD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B49TY1MD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B49TY1MD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
