window.products.push({"id":514608,"name":"Large Silicone Dish Drying Mat with High Ridges for Quick Drying 21'' x 18'' Easy to Clean, Silicone Trivet, Dish Drying Pad, Drying Mat for Counterto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PzDYV4maL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We believe home is where the heart is, where it should feel pleasant and restful. We strive to bring you everyday objects that make you feel like your home is your sanctum Our Commitments ✔️ To only make products that stand out from the others and improve your daily life✔️ To only make products that are affordable, stylish, high quality and durable✔️ To only make products with exceptional craftsmanship, which go through thorough testing and quality control. No detail is overlooked and there are no cutting corners Everything we make is built to last Product Specs Size: Full mat 21x18 inch, Folded in half mat 10.5x18 inchWeight: 1.7lbsWhat’s in the box: 1 Silicone Drying MatWarranty: 60 days money-back guarantee, 2 years warranty Features ● Durable and long-lasting - we only use premium natural silicone and our manufacturer has close to 20 years experience in manufacturing● Made from BPA-free food-grade silicone - your safety is our top priority● Dishwasher safe - the mat is really easy to clean! It will not hold onto smell like microfiber mats and it’s way easier to clean than dish racks● High slanted ridges (¼ inch) and wide gaps for fast drying. Better airflow means faster drying!● Raised edges to prevent water from overflowing and making a mess on your counter● Designed with a draining hole at the bottom of the mat to easily to drain water out ● Save counter space and feel free in your kitchen- fold the dish drying pad in half when you have a small load of dishes or easily store it by rolling it or hanging it● Beautiful design - complement your kitchen with our nature design and pleasing colors● Silicone dish drying mat is soft, shock-absorbent and non-slip - it will protect your dishes from scratching and breaking ● Heat resistant up to 450 degrees F - it can be used as a silicone trivet to protect your counter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PzDYV4maL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honbeanify","source_asin":"B089KS9VX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089KS9VX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089KS9VX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
