window.products.push({"id":514773,"name":"GOKING Crystal Glass Flower Vases Set for Modern Decor, 2 PCS Colorful Centerpiece Table Decorations, Acrylic Small Minimalist Dining Decor Clear Vase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iRfAi02IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This completely unique and modern design acrylic vase is an excellent alternative to glass vases as it retains the clarity and delicacy of glass while also being resistant to breakage, which is a great solution to the problem that glass can be dangerous around children or pets. Each pair of contrasting color vases comes with an exquisite packaging box and is a gift for someone special in your life on a birthday, party, graduation, anniversary, wedding, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Christmas, housewarming or any special occasion. It cannot hold a big bunch of flowers but it will be a nice decoration for your home, office, table, cafe, restaurant, gallery or hotel. Uses: LEGO Flower Bouquet 10280 LEGO Iconic Rose 40460 LEGO Iconic Tulip 40461 fresh flower with water dried flowers lucky bamboo brush holder table centerpieces Popular with: event planners florists interior designers restaurants home decorators Color:  Pink & Yellow Blue & Yelow Pink & Green Blue & Pink Green & Blue Material: Acrylic Style:  Modern, luxury Measurements:  Length 1.97 inches (5 cm), Width 1.97 inches (5 cm), Height 6.3 inches (16 cm)Please allow 1-2cm measuring deviation due to manual measurement. Package Including: 2 x colorful vase Note:  Flower arrangement is not included.The actual product may be smaller than the picture you see. Please pay attention to the size.Because this vase is handmade, please allow the actual items to be slightly different from the pictures, but this also makes your vase have unique charm. Due to the different monitor and light effect, the actual color of the item might be slightly different from the color showed on the pictures. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iRfAi02IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B09C39YZRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C39YZRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C39YZRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
