window.products.push({"id":514859,"name":"Neck Fan Portable,3000mah Hands Free Rechargeable Battery Operated,3 Speeds USB Powered Wearable Bladeless Leafless Hanging Personal Cooling,360 Rotat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rczCd+kWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Personal Cooler For Hot Summer】 the wearable neck fan is 7.4 oz. And has a fashionable design. Good airflow can be adjusted between 3 speeds: Low, medium, and high, depending on your needs. Easy to fit in any backpack, good for while working out in the gym, jogging, hiking or during vacation. The portable neck fan looks like headphones so the coolest person is you. The battery lasts 3-16 hours, can be easily charged. The neck fan is adjustable so you can make it narrow or wide if needed 【3 Speeds Adjustable Mini Fan】 portable USB neck fan with low/medium/high 3 speed modes provide you more choices in different temperature environments. Adjust appropriate fan speed by pressing the power button directly. The airflow range of 68 air outlets at the neck reaches 80%. The small neck fan is suitable for jogging, working, walking, playing sports, fishing, cooking, hiking and traveling, all indoor activities or outdoor exercises. A good fan against the hot flush 【4-16 HRS Long Cooling Fan】 the battery operated neck fan have two 3000ah rechargeable batteries, that provide 4-16 working hours duration (depend on different speeds). Rechargeable fan powered by USB and compatible with pc/laptop/power bank(use right out of the box, battery included). The long life battery supports 3500-5200 rmp of the inside fan, also, the usb rechargeable fans are more energy-saving and more efficient. No matter how long you using, the body of the neck fan will not get hot 【Mild Noise & Neck Airflow】 portable cooling neck fans use two brushless motors to make the noise less than 20db, noise level is fairly mild. The airflow of the hanging cooler fan goes around the back of neck so the cool flush blues up neck all around not just right into the face. The personal fan provides cooling air circulation in any direction because of the multiple air outlets around the neck fans and bendable design. The silicone makes the hands free neckband fan softer and quieter 【Two Years Warranty & Elegant Gift】 take the cooling personal fan for yourself or your family as a gift, be freer, more comfortable, more fashionable, and enjoy the cold flush of hot summer everywhere and anytime. And don't worry about the after-sale service, we offer a two-year warranty to assure the best experience for you. Note: The hanging neck fan creates a comfortable and relaxing atmosphere that helps you dry all day long. It's the best gift for mother's day！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rczCd+kWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JFOMOYGI","source_asin":"B093GFJ3GB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GFJ3GB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GFJ3GB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
