window.products.push({"id":514881,"name":"POTRAS Floating Shelves, Rustic Wood Wall Shelves for Living Room Set of 4, Farmhouse Style Wooden Floating Shelf Wall Mounted for Bathroom, Kitchen, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uFzrRyytL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Note: **Don't fit drywall.**Please confirm the diameter of your drill bit and the diameter of anchor are consistent before installation. If not, the screw and anchor may loosen ,slide in and out or fall off.** For More, And For You - Full Size Shelves: 16.5\"L×6\"W×0.6\"H (SET of 4). Max Weight Capacity: 40 lb. POTRAS Floating Shelves could give you extra storage in bathroom, guest bathroom, kitchen, living room, and perfect to add some rustic charm to room.Let’s make life simpler. Stylish Yet Rustic - POTRAS Wood Floating Shelves are made of solid Paulownia wood without any extra processing. Our floating shelves restore the carbonized color and texture of the wood itself through the charcoal roasting process, which can give you the modern/rustic experience. Our woods grows naturally, so each piece of wood has a unique wood grain and color. This is also the charm of natural wood. Easy to Assemble & DIY - Just 4pcs shelf boards(No pre-drilled holes) and 8pcs shelf bracket. POTRAS Floating Shelves pursue a principle: Using Less to Accomplish More. So our shelves are super easy to assemble and DIY. The metal bracket can be installed on the top or bottom of the floating shelf. You can use it as corner shelf, bathroom shelf, bedroom shelf, kitchen shelf, and plant shelf. Just create your own wall space. Super Sturdy - All mounting hardware included: Wall Screw & Plastic Screw Anchor: 1-1/2”×16pcs, Wood Screw: 3/5”×16pcs; Max Weight Capacity: 40 lb. We chose this combination after over 1000 tests. No need to worry about the stability, just put it on, and our floating shelves can bear the weight of your love. We Are POTRAS - POTRAS was created by Yao Yinhe, a craftswoman who has devoted over 40 years to her work. Our product might be not so perfect because of handmade, but if you have any advice, please let us know how to do it better. We know that a company that doesn't give true love to their customers can't obtain trust and support of them. And if you feel good with our product, we'll be appreciated if you could share this love and product using experience with others.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uFzrRyytL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POTRAS","source_asin":"B09JK9Q9LD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JK9Q9LD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JK9Q9LD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
