window.products.push({"id":514901,"name":"Alessi \"Antechinus\" Cheese Knife in Steel Aisi 420 Mirror Polished, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IMNkS9yFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Anita Dineen has designed the cheese knife \"Ant echinus\". Its lines recall both the stylized forms of a slice of cheese and those of a little mouse intent on enjoying his favorite food. The curve creates a sensuous grip, giving the knife a balanced and aesthetically pleasing aspect. Ant echinus can stand on its blade and doesn't need any support: the fact that both sides of the blade are sharpened, also make it suitable for use as a cheese cutter for mature cheeses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IMNkS9yFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alessi","source_asin":"B01569ZIRO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-514901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01569ZIRO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01569ZIRO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
